  "doc_id": "981aa243a164434fb77f111966f81b58",
  "text": "### 4. Regulatory Updates (FCA Circulars)  \n**Summary:**\nHead of Compliance briefed committee on FCA Circulars issued in Q1 2026.  \n**Key Circulars:**\n1. **FCA-COBS-2026-03:** Enhanced KYC for high-risk customers\n- Deadline: March 1, 2026 (enforcement date)\n- Status: **Compliant** (procedures updated, staff trained)\n- Action: Ongoing monitoring of implementation effectiveness  \n2. **FCA-OP-2026-01:** Open Banking API extension\n- Deadline: June 30, 2026\n- Status: **In Progress** (development on track)\n- Action: CTO to report in June 2026 meeting  \n3. **FCA-OPER-2026-04:** Operational Resilience standards\n- Deadline: Ongoing (best practice)\n- Status: **Compliant** (RTO/RPO meet expectations)\n- Action: Annual documentation review in Q4 2026  \n**Committee Observation:**\n- FirstUK Bank responding well to regulatory changes\n- No anticipated breaches or compliance issues\n- Recommend continued proactive monitoring  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 7/14",
